  "reason": "The Free plan claims 50 requests/day, all statistics endpoints and current-season-only access, while pre-match/live odds are excluded. The match-stats endpoint documents corners, yellow cards and red cards, but coverage is competition/season-dependent and no authenticated Serie A 2026/27 field-level response was inspected. Terms allow caching/storing and displaying data only while the account and plan remain active; the licence ends when the account or terms end and raw redistribution is forbidden. The terms do not explicitly grant internal ML inference/training, identify upstream providers, or document private raw archive retention after termination. The stats endpoint documents no source-observation or per-field correction timestamp. No account, key, API request, download, feature calculation, inference or Supabase access was performed. Keep HOLD until written rights/use/retention clarification and a minimal owner-authorized Free-tier field-coverage test can be completed with private raw bytes, local UTC receipt time and SHA-256."
